        <view class="davidbmtk_top_txt">选择最适合你的品牌参与方式，根据你的时间安排和社交偏好选择最适合的方式</view>
        <view class="davidbmtk_top_gb" bindtap="davidClose" aria-role="button" aria-label="关闭" hover-class="cy-pressed" hover-stay-time="80"><cy-icon name="close-sm" size="44" /></view>
      </view>
      <view class="davidbmtk_box">
        <view class="davidbmtk_box_top">
